<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Freiburg Guide: 10 places – Münstermarkt, Schlossberg, Bächle &amp; Kaiserstuhl – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/freiburg/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Münstermarkt</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come early on Saturday, eat a Lange Rote and go up the Schlossberg afterwards. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/freiburg/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>7.8528,47.99583,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Schlossberg</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Go up at sunset and take water. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/freiburg/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>7.86755,47.99749,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Freiburg Minster &amp; tower</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Climb the tower in the morning, then the view is often clearer. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/freiburg/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>7.85292,47.99555,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Historical Merchants’ Hall, town hall &amp; city gates</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Start at the cathedral square and walk a loop through the old town. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/freiburg/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>7.85267,47.99497,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Augustiner Museum</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · A perfect rainy-day tip close to the minster. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/freiburg/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>7.85325,47.99381,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Gerberau &amp; Fischerau – the canal quarter</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the evening for atmosphere and lights. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/freiburg/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>7.85328,47.99294,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Vauban – eco district</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Take the tram there and eat in one of the cafés. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/freiburg/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>7.8236,47.97637,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Schauinsland – cable car &amp; views</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Go up in clear weather and bring a jacket. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/freiburg/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>7.87841,47.92281,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Kaiserstuhl – vineyards on the doorstep</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Plan an afternoon and taste wine on site. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/freiburg/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>7.65492,48.08272,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
